    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the popular Millbourne estate, 28 Millbourne Close is a beautifully presented four-bedroom, three-storey semi-detached home, offering spacious and versatile accommodation together with an excellent A3 energy rating and a south-facing rear garden.\n\nOn the ground floor, the kitchen / dining room is a particularly bright and welcoming space. The contemporary kitchen is complemented by a generous dining area with plenty of room for a large family table, while the windows and glazed French doors bring an abundance of natural light into the room. French doors lead directly from the dining area to the south-facing rear garden, creating a lovely connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces and making this an ideal room for family life and entertaining. \n\nOutside, the south-facing rear garden is a particularly appealing feature of the property. The property offers a self-contained unit, adding another layer of flexibility for extended family, guests or independent living. To the front of the property are two car parking spaces. \n\nThe living room, located to the front of the property is spacious, modern and beautifully designed, creating a comfortable and inviting space to relax and unwind. A guest WC completes the ground floor, adding further convenience to an already well-designed and practical layout.\n\nThe first floor comprises of three bedrooms, including one with its own en-suite, together with a main family bathroom. Fitted wardrobes provide excellent storage while keeping the bedrooms feeling spacious and uncluttered, creating comfortable and practical accommodation.\n\nOn the second floor is an exceptionally spacious and bright fourth bedroom, offering a wonderful sense of privacy and plenty of room to create a comfortable retreat. The bedroom is complemented by a modern en-suite bathroom, making this an impressive and versatile space within the home.\n\nThe property also benefits from an impressive A3 energy rating, together with triple-glazed windows, solar panels for water heating and gas-fired central heating with a recently fitted new boiler, all contributing to a comfortable and energy-efficient home.\n\n28 Millbourne Close is an exceptional family home, offering exceptional space, contemporary interiors and flexible accommodation across three floors. From the bright kitchen / dining space and comfortable living room to the four spacious bedrooms, south-facing rear garden and granny-flat potential, every aspect of the property has been designed to offer space and flexibility. \n\nBeautifully presented and energy efficient, this is a home that can comfortably adapt to family life for many years to come and truly needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nSome images may have been digitally enhanced or virtually staged to illustrate the property's potential. All measurements and floor areas are approximate and have been given in good faith. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details and measurements through their own inspection.\n\nSummary of 28 Millbourne Close: -\n4 bed | 3 bath\nBuilt in 2016\nApprox. 149.1 sqm\nThree-storey semi-detached home\nA3 energy rating\nBeautifully presented throughout\nSelf-contained unit to rear\nTwo parking spaces\nSpacious living room\nBright kitchen / dining room\nContemporary fitted kitchen\nFrench doors leading to the rear garden\nSouth-facing rear garden\nTop-floor bedroom with its own bathroom\nFitted wardrobes throughout\nTriple-glazed windows\nSolar panels for water heating\nGas-fired central heating\nRecently fitted new boiler\n"
      },
